{"version":1,"content":"<p>星巴克「消費入座」新規落地首日，一個場景再次引發了輿論爭議。據央廣網報道，楊女士在客流稀少的時段臨時參加一場線上會議，本打算會後下單，卻在約一個半小時內被店員五次提醒點單。「商家盈利、推行消費入座本身沒有問題，但頻繁催促容易讓顧客產生一種『攆你走』的感受。」</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583594.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T16:24:54.710389+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T16:07:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T16:18:30.670116+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T16:18:30.670116+00:00","content_hash":"aef936730aeb705ad369841a25283b9740225e3acec7bae3808cef20c8bd4d98","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}